<SiteLayout path="privacy" title="Enquiry Privacy Information | LEDJS" description="How LEDJS uses the details you choose to share when asking about wedding and event entertainment.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><h1>Your enquiry<br />details.</h1><p>Information about contacting LEDJS and the details you choose to share.</p></div></section><article class="page-copy"><h2>What you share</h2><p>An enquiry can include your name, email, event type, county, venue, date, chosen service and optional phone, guest numbers or notes. The wedding questionnaire collects the planning information you choose to provide.</p><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>LEDJS uses these details to answer your request, discuss availability, prepare a quote and plan any agreed service. Please avoid including sensitive information that isn't needed for your event.</p><h2>Contact channels</h2><p>When online forms are enabled, submissions are handled using Netlify Forms and notification emails through Resend. If you choose WhatsApp, your conversation is handled through that service. Your enquiry isn't a marketing subscription.</p><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <a href="mailto:dave@theledjs.ie">dave@theledjs.ie</a> to ask about access, correction or deletion of details you have shared. The applicable retention and processing arrangements should be confirmed with LEDJS.</p></article>
</SiteLayout>
